    <rigor-hint>STANDARD</rigor-hint>
    <rigor-reason>TEST-MODIFYING: touches tests/** and adds an eval family (integration-test tag) — code-review + adr-check run unconditionally per root §8 override row.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Eval-corpus design is judgment-heavy — it defines the correctness contract (what "zero cross-pairing" means as machine-checkable assertions), a new-abstraction/authoring task per Step 3.5.5b opus triggers.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
